    "name": "Very Unserious Game",
    "steam_appid": 3637040,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Innovality</strong>, the leading startup in the innovation market! As a futur team member, you must take part in this revolutionary e-learning experience to develop your 2.0 thinker mindset. This game will provide you with all the knowledge you need to join the Great Innovality Family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.poster.avif?t=1748591205\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.webm?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.mp4?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Very Unserious Game</i> is a <strong>short narrative game</strong> (around twenty minutes), playable with just a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a\u00a0<strong>parody</strong> of serious games and a satire of the wonderful world of business, this game takes you through an interview like no other to join Innovality, an innovation startup that innovates (well... in theory).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a series of absurd e-learning quizzes and situations as familiar as they are uncomfortable, you\u2019ll discover the joys of corporate jargon, vague objectives, and &quot;inspiring&quot; company values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.poster.avif?t=1748591205\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.webm?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.mp4?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive quizzes, born from intensive brainstorming sessions between experts in value creation, holistic management, and strategic fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disruptive pedagogy, co-created in an agile mode by a cross-functional innovation team focused on implicit knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth-oriented feedback, designed to turn every mistake into a lever for progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An authentic immersion in company culture, blending vertical storytelling, team synergy, and KPI-compatible benevolence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mechanics inspired by the best practices in managerial gamification, validated by PowerPoint slides with high narrative value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trigger warning: This game contains scenes of workplace harassment/violence. While the goal is to expose them, these scenes may offend your sensibilities.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Innovality</strong>, the leading startup in the innovation market! As a futur team member, you must take part in this revolutionary e-learning experience to develop your 2.0 thinker mindset. This game will provide you with all the knowledge you need to join the Great Innovality Family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.poster.avif?t=1748591205\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.webm?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/bb87fa091ddb961db1ff306bc6f70fd6.mp4?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Very Unserious Game</i> is a <strong>short narrative game</strong> (around twenty minutes), playable with just a mouse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a\u00a0<strong>parody</strong> of serious games and a satire of the wonderful world of business, this game takes you through an interview like no other to join Innovality, an innovation startup that innovates (well... in theory).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through a series of absurd e-learning quizzes and situations as familiar as they are uncomfortable, you\u2019ll discover the joys of corporate jargon, vague objectives, and &quot;inspiring&quot; company values.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.poster.avif?t=1748591205\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.webm?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3637040/extras/958f6e76b31c2a7cef77807968e67c43.mp4?t=1748591205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAIN FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive quizzes, born from intensive brainstorming sessions between experts in value creation, holistic management, and strategic fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disruptive pedagogy, co-created in an agile mode by a cross-functional innovation team focused on implicit knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Growth-oriented feedback, designed to turn every mistake into a lever for progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An authentic immersion in company culture, blending vertical storytelling, team synergy, and KPI-compatible benevolence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game mechanics inspired by the best practices in managerial gamification, validated by PowerPoint slides with high narrative value.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Trigger warning: This game contains scenes of workplace harassment/violence. While the goal is to expose them, these scenes may offend your sensibilities.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Are you looking for a new job that will give meaning to your life? The Innovality family is ready to welcome you! Between smart innovation and spontaneous conference calls, grow into a valued team member in a cutting-edge startup!",
